</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib70" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Wratil et al.,  (2023)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Wratil, C., Wäckerle, J., and Proksch, S.-O. (2023).

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">Government Rhetoric and the Representation of Public Opinion in International Negotiations.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib70.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">American Political Science Review</span>, 117(3):1105–1122.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib71" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Zhou and Tchetgen,  (2024)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Zhou, Y. and Tchetgen, E. T. (2024).

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">Causal inference for a hidden treatment.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib71.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">arXiv preprint arXiv:2405.09080</span>.

</span></li>
      
