<p id="A2.SS3.p4.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS3.p4.3.1" class="ltx_text">Then, we analyze each term. For <math id="A2.SS3.p4.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H_{21}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>21</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H_{21}</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
