<p id="A2.SS3.p7.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS3.p7.4.1" class="ltx_text">where <math id="A2.SS3.p7.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{E}_{\mathcal{P}}[\cdot]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}_{\mathcal{P}}[\cdot]</annotation></semantics></math> is the expectation operator with respect to the population distribution <math id="A2.SS3.p7.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{P}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{P}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A2.SS3.p7.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{E}_{\hat{\mathcal{P}}_{n}}[\cdot]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mover accent="true"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>n</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}_{\hat{\mathcal{P}}_{n}}[\cdot]</annotation></semantics></math> is the expectation operator with respect to the empirical distribution <math id="A2.SS3.p7.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\mathcal{P}}_{n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>n</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\mathcal{P}}_{n}</annotation></semantics></math>, and</span></p>
<table id="A2.EGx71" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex151"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex151.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle R_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle R_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex151.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}_{\mathcal{P}}\biggl[\frac{\mathbbm{1}\{S_{i}=1\}}{\mathbb{P}(S_{i}=1)}\cdot\frac{\mathbb{E}_{\hat{\mathcal{P}}_{n}}[\mathbbm{1}\{T_{i}=t\}\mid\hat{\bm{f}}(\bm{Y}_{i}),\bm{Z}_{i}]}{\mathbb{E}_{\hat{\mathcal{P}}_{n}}[\mathbbm{1}\{T_{i}=t\}\mid\bm{Z}_{i}]}\biggl(\tilde{L}_{i}-\mathbb{E}_{\hat{\mathcal{P}}_{n}}[\tilde{L}_{i}\mid\hat{\bm{f}}(\bm{Y}_{i}),\bm{Z}_{i}]\biggr)\biggr]," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">[</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>𝟙</mn><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>S</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>n</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mn>𝟙</mn><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>T</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒇</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒀</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>𝒁</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>n</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mn>𝟙</mn><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>T</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>𝒁</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>L</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mover accent="true"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>n</mi></msub></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>L</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒇</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒀</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒁</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">]</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}_{\mathcal{P}}\biggl[\frac{\mathbbm{1}\{S_{i}=1\}}{\mathbb{P}(S_{i}=1)}\cdot\frac{\mathbb{E}_{\hat{\mathcal{P}}_{n}}[\mathbbm{1}\{T_{i}=t\}\mid\hat{\bm{f}}(\bm{Y}_{i}),\bm{Z}_{i}]}{\mathbb{E}_{\hat{\mathcal{P}}_{n}}[\mathbbm{1}\{T_{i}=t\}\mid\bm{Z}_{i}]}\biggl(\tilde{L}_{i}-\mathbb{E}_{\hat{\mathcal{P}}_{n}}[\tilde{L}_{i}\mid\hat{\bm{f}}(\bm{Y}_{i}),\bm{Z}_{i}]\biggr)\biggr],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex152"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
