<p id="A2.SS3.p8.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS3.p8.1.1" class="ltx_text">For <math id="A2.SS3.p8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{1}</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
